silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_09_render_integrity_and_governance_sections_02_cannon_absorption_gate_concrete_anchor_node1 silm:hasLongDescription "The CannonAbsorptionGateSourceNode is Cannon output (external input claiming to be about Mittens). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Source', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
